@host = http://localhost:3000

### Verificar saúde
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Consultar métricas
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard

### Buscar opções de clientes
GET {{host}}/api/customers/options

### Buscar faturas
GET {{host}}/api/invoices

### Buscar fatura por identificador
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/1

### Buscar fatura por identificador inválido
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/abc

### Buscar fatura por identificador inexistente
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/999999

### Criar fatura
POST {{host}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "pending",
    "issueDate": "2026-11-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-11-30"
}

### Criar fatura sem corpo
POST {{host}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

### Criar fatura com valor zerado
POST {{host}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 0,
    "status": "pending",
    "issueDate": "2026-11-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-11-30"
}

### Criar fatura com situação inválida
POST {{host}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "cancelled",
    "issueDate": "2026-11-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-11-30"
}

### Criar fatura com data de vencimento anterior à data de emissão
POST {{host}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "pending",
    "issueDate": "2026-11-30",
    "dueDate": "2026-11-01"
}

### Criar fatura com data inexistente
POST {{host}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "pending",
    "issueDate": "2026-11-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-11-31"
}

### Atualizar fatura
PUT {{host}}/api/invoices/181
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "paid",
    "issueDate": "2026-11-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-11-22"
}

### Deletar fatura
DELETE {{host}}/api/invoices/181
